      "id": "botchan-s11-p0065",
      "source_en": "Porcupine and I wished to take them by surprise on their return home, but when they would come out of the saloon nobody could tell. Porcupine, going downstairs, asked them to leave the door unlocked, as business might suddenly call us out even at midnight. It is a wonder to think how they agreed to his request. In all probability, they might have thought us burglars.",
